repository-code: "https://github.com/tradephantom/arcana"
url: "https://getaxcp.com"
abstract: >-
  ARCANA is an open research and reference framework for model-bounded
  autonomy accounting in agentic systems. The public implementation and
  benchmark evidence are deterministic and synthetic, not production
  calibration evidence or proof of absolute safety.
keywords:
  - "agentic systems"
  - "autonomy accounting"
  - "model-bounded risk"
  - "capability graphs"
  - "calibration uncertainty"
  - "FastGate"
